NOTE ON DATA AND MODELS

This MIT licence covers the source code in this repository.

The variant data this project is built on comes from the FORUM-TB dataset
(https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/nanzhen/forum-tb), which is published under
CC BY-SA 4.0. The derived artefacts distributed here -- the feature matrix, the
feature dictionary in data/variant_panel/, and the trained model bundles in
models/ -- are derivative works of that data and are shared under the same
CC BY-SA 4.0 terms.

Laboratory susceptibility results in data/phenotypes.csv are compiled from
BV-BRC, the CRyPTIC consortium reuse table, and NCBI Pathogen Detection. Each
label carries a source column naming its origin. Cite those sources when using
this data; see the attribution table in README.md.

NOT FOR CLINICAL USE. The models are not clinically validated, their scores are
uncalibrated, and nothing here is approved for diagnostic or treatment purposes.
